(NAVIGATOR_SOURCE="navigator" + payload builders), pydantic request/
response schemas, and the /api/v1/agent router (proposals, runs,
approvals). Each create/transition persists an EventRow with
source="navigator" in the request session and best-effort publishes on
the bus. Router registered unconditionally in api/v1/__init__.py.

